      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621195EE4F60554AFF0C000A4F605F884E8689E38D857EA78FDB53165417FF1F001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就让这个宝可梦训练家\n来教教我们吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
